<!-- The E.D. Cal. motion's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the typst
     template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 12 pt (size 24 half points); Body Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst
     pitch, L.R. 130(c) double spaced) with a half-inch indent, the headings in them; single lines in 12 pt boxes
     (typst pitch-single: half a numbered line). docx/caed-motion-brief.lua writes every paragraph's own spacing, the
     footer with the numbered lines (L.R. 130(b), (d)) and the three sections (cover and notice, tables, memorandum).
     Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" size="24" body="480" single="240" indent="720" heading="480" heading-before="0" heading-after="0"/>
